@startuml authentication_registration
title Registration and Email Confirmation - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Client
participant "Tutoring.Api" as Api
participant "Registration Handler" as RegistrationHandler
database "SQL Server" as Database
participant OutboxProcessor
queue RabbitMQ
participant EmailConsumer
participant EmailEventDispatcher
participant SmtpMailer
participant "SMTP / Mailpit" as Smtp

Client -> Api : POST /api/auth/register/{student|tutor}
Api -> RegistrationHandler : MediatR command
RegistrationHandler -> Database : Save pending account, verification-token hash,\nrole entity, and outbox event
Database --> RegistrationHandler : committed
RegistrationHandler --> Api : created
Api --> Client : 201 Created

OutboxProcessor -> Database : Read unprocessed outbox event
OutboxProcessor -> RabbitMQ : Publish UserRegistered event\n(includes raw verification token)
OutboxProcessor -> Database : Mark event processed
RabbitMQ -> EmailConsumer : Deliver email event
EmailConsumer -> EmailEventDispatcher : Dispatch UserRegistered
EmailEventDispatcher -> SmtpMailer : Send confirmation email
SmtpMailer -> Smtp : Send email
Smtp --> Client : Confirmation link

Client -> Api : GET /api/auth/email/confirm?token=...
Api -> Database : Find token hash; validate unused and unexpired
alt valid token
    Api -> Database : Activate account and mark token used
    Api --> Client : 200 OK
else unknown, expired, or used token
    Api --> Client : 401 ProblemDetails
end
@enduml
